   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify;">The Company&#8217;s accounts payable and accrued liabilities consist of the following (in thousands):</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
